<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="fr-sq" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Fries/Squash</title>

  <p>
    Ingredients
  </p>
  <tabular>
    <row>
      <cell>Potatoes, sweet potatoes, or peeled squash, washed and sliced into fries or cubes</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 tablespoon olive oil</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>Seasonings (e.g. salt, pepper, smoked paprika)</cell>
    </row>
  </tabular>

  <p>Instructions
    <ol>
      <li>
        <p>
          Slice potatoes/squash into fries or cubes.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          In a mixing bowl, mix oil and seasonings.  Add the potatoes/squash and toss through the oil/seasoning mixture.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Place the fries/cubes in the air fryer basket. Air fry at <m>400^\circ</m> for 14 minutes (fries) or 19 minutes? (squash), tossing halfway through.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </p>

  <p>
    Notes:
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</section>